{"id":"n63723-7-11","stage":0,"title":"내려가다 · 下跌","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63723-7-11-1","ko":"경기가 많이 좋아진 것 같아.","zh":"看来经济状况好多了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"경기가","meaning":"经济状况","explanation":"경기：经济状况；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25710","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아진","meaning":"好，强；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"좋다：好，强；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"15","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"经济状况","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"25710","definition":"买卖或交易中表现出的景气与不景气等，与经济领域有关的状况。","pronunciation":["경기"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，强","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"和别的相比，质量或水平等更高。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/44b3ce73658e8c40a967.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63723-7-11-2","ko":"응. 실업률도 많이 내려갔대.","zh":"嗯，据说失业率也大幅下降了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실업률도","meaning":"失业率","explanation":"실업률：失业率；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"실업률","audio":"/audio/67eb98c71e2a223c0953.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91365","senseId":"1","lemma":"실업률","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려갔대.","meaning":"下跌，下降","explanation":"내려가다：下跌，下降；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"내려가다","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63723","senseId":"7","lemma":"내려가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"67eb98c71e2a223c","term":"실업률","zh":"失业率","audio":"/audio/67eb98c71e2a223c0953.mp3","entryId":"91365","definition":"在有工作意愿和工作能力的人口当中失业者占据的比例。","pronunciation":["시럼뉼"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"d27a99abb5cf233c","term":"내려가다","zh":"下跌，下降","audio":"/audio/d27a99abb5cf233cc101.mp3","entryId":"63723","definition":"价格、统计数据、温度或物价等降下来。","pronunciation":["내려가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fc654b3cd41bb5bef13b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.898,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63723","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"7","sourceLevel":"초급","day":29,"sequenceScore":1.2985,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，据说失业率也大幅下降了。","没有卫生纸了。怎么办？","看来经济状况好多了啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯，据说失业率也大幅下降了。","看来经济状况好多了啊。","没有卫生纸了。怎么办？"],"answer":0}]}
